<node id="paper::broad_0774386e5705dc5099bf::claim_cip_outer_two_electrode">
  <data key="d4">ObservationClaim</data>
  <data key="d5">CIP can be applied to outer-sphere reactions and biased two-electrode systems, whereas the constant Fermi-level approach is inadequate for these cases.</data>
  <data key="d18">method_scope</data>
  <data key="d19">CIP can be applied to outer-sphere reactions and biased two-electrode systems, whereas the constant Fermi-level approach is inadequate for these cases.</data>
  <data key="d20">computational</data>
  <data key="d6">The abstract presents CIP as addressing the limitations of constant-Fermi-level GCE-DFT for these systems.</data>
  <data key="d7">["claim_cip_outer_two_electrode"]</data>
  <data key="d8">1</data>
  <data key="d9">broad_mechanism_abstract</data>
  <data key="d10">broad_abstract_support</data>
